Title:  To see a world in a grain of sand

Seq:    12.6.15.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Blake, William|William Blake]], 1863, from the poem "[[Auguries of Innocence]]"

Timestamp: 20251023200746

Date Added: 2025-10-23 14:07:46 -0600

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:07 -0600

Referenced In: We retain a sense of wonder

Body:

To see a world in a grain of sand  
And heaven in a wild flower  
Hold infinity in the palm of your hand  
And eternity in an hour.
